<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - O'Reilly started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - O'Reilly started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Securities Corp of Iowa analyst Patrick Dunkerley said he started coverage of O'Reilly Automotive Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the company, a retailer and supplier of aftermarket auto parts, were up 1/8 to 34-5/8.</p>
<p>--&quot;Earnings estimates are $1.85 for 1996 and $2.23 for 1997,&quot; Dunkerley said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
